        {
            "block_label": "figure_title",
            "block_content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">FIG. 2. Amplitude spectral density (ASD) of various components in A channel. All spectra except for the PT SGWB are selected from 2.8_EQ dataset; the latter are derived from 2.9_EQ dataset. Spectra estimated from observational results are plotted with solid lines, while theoretically calculated spectra are shown with dashed lines. Grey shaded regions denote frequencies notched out in our analysis.</div>\n",
            "block_bbox": [
